{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>The Elohim of the heavens will send His angel.</b> May it be His will that He send His angel from His heavenly abode, since it was from there that He took me, and to Him the causes are arranged so to act in such a manner that my son will not need to go there." "<b>And who spoke to me.</b> And further, that He spoke to me, saying: כִּי בְיִצְחָק יִקָּרֵא לְךָ זָרַע (Genesis 21:12)." "<b>And who swore to me.</b> And since He swore and will not relent, He will without doubt arrange that my son take a wife suited to him, to establish seed ready to fulfill in him His oath."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:20.591554619Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}